{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strange Days</strong> brings the retro charm of <strong>Game Boy</strong> <strong>Color</strong> to <strong>Steam</strong> in a bizarre, comedy-thriller adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/Sprite-0001.gif?t=1746888000\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The package</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> When <strong>Niko</strong> and <strong>Blaze</strong> are tasked with delivering a mysterious package to a strange man in an abandoned factory, they uncover much more than they bargained for\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/gb-studio_P2zscKiKI5.gif?t=1746888000\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UFO sightings in Triton</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rumors of <strong>UFOs</strong> have everyone in Triton talking. <strong>Detective Misterio</strong> and <strong>Aura</strong> head into the nearby forest to separate fact from fiction. Are the aliens real\u2026 or just a town legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/gb-studio_aHeR30Mi8l.gif?t=1746888000\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>World's end</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> As you explore retro pixel art environments with nostalgic chiptune music, interrogate witnesses and solve clever puzzles, each clue draws you closer to a terrifying truth\u2014before it\u2019s too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/gb-studio_vw025fiSFS.gif?t=1746888000\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Play as <strong>different characters</strong> with unique perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Retro-inspired pixel art</strong> and <strong>chiptune soundtrack</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Puzzle-solving, exploration</strong>, and <strong>light detective mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Side <strong>mini-games</strong> integrated into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714040?t=1746888000","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/33b4a1174e1d8f0a3b100b2e6ec8f686c668cd4d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746888000","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/c5306d3e1cefe13a27087d94181bf34948460348/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746888000","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/c5306d3e1cefe13a27087d94181bf34948460348/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746888000","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strange Days</strong> brings the retro charm of <strong>Game Boy</strong> <strong>Color</strong> to <strong>Steam</strong> in a bizarre, comedy-thriller adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/Sprite-0001.gif?t=1746888000\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The package</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> When <strong>Niko</strong> and <strong>Blaze</strong> are tasked with delivering a mysterious package to a strange man in an abandoned factory, they uncover much more than they bargained for\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/gb-studio_P2zscKiKI5.gif?t=1746888000\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UFO sightings in Triton</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rumors of <strong>UFOs</strong> have everyone in Triton talking. <strong>Detective Misterio</strong> and <strong>Aura</strong> head into the nearby forest to separate fact from fiction. Are the aliens real\u2026 or just a town legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/gb-studio_aHeR30Mi8l.gif?t=1746888000\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>World's end</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> As you explore retro pixel art environments with nostalgic chiptune music, interrogate witnesses and solve clever puzzles, each clue draws you closer to a terrifying truth\u2014before it\u2019s too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/extras/gb-studio_vw025fiSFS.gif?t=1746888000\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Play as <strong>different characters</strong> with unique perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Retro-inspired pixel art</strong> and <strong>chiptune soundtrack</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Puzzle-solving, exploration</strong>, and <strong>light detective mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Side <strong>mini-games</strong> integrated into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Urigami"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714040/d495f391356711c4e9328ae9ddcdc21808136f7d/header.jpg?t=1746888000","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2023 Urigami. Strange Days\u2122 is a trademark of Urigami. All rights reserved worldwide.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Strange D